%N A398288 Number of unsatisfiable 3-SAT formulas with 5 variables and n clauses in the multiset clause model.
%C A398288 Clauses are multisets of 3 literals chosen from {x_1, ..., x_5, not x_1, ..., not x_5}; repeated literals inside a clause are allowed. A formula is a multiset of n such clauses, so repeated clauses are also allowed.
%C A398288 This is row 5 of the array A396351; that is, a(n) = A396351(5,n).
%C A398288 There are binomial(2*5+2,3) = binomial(12,3) = 220 clause types over 5 variables, so the total number of n-clause formulas is binomial(n+219,n), and a(n) is that total minus the number of satisfiable formulas A397492(5,n).
%D A398288 Stephen A. Cook, The complexity of theorem-proving procedures, Proceedings of the Third Annual ACM Symposium on Theory of Computing, 1971, 151-158.
%H A398288 <a href="/index/Rec#order_220">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, order 220.
%F A398288 a(n) = binomial(n+219,n) - A397492(5,n).
%F A398288 a(n) = binomial(n+219,n) - 32*binomial(n+184,n) + 80*binomial(n+169,n) + 160*binomial(n+159,n) - 320*binomial(n+154,n) + 160*binomial(n+153,n) + 80*binomial(n+150,n) + 96*binomial(n+149,n) - 960*binomial(n+144,n) - 320*binomial(n+140,n) + 1280*binomial(n+139,n) - 640*binomial(n+138,n) + 1040*binomial(n+135,n) - 1440*binomial(n+134,n) - 960*binomial(n+131,n) - 960*binomial(n+130,n) + 4320*binomial(n+129,n) - 320*binomial(n+128,n) + 80*binomial(n+127,n) + 480*binomial(n+126,n) + 2560*binomial(n+125,n) - 5120*binomial(n+124,n) + 840*binomial(n+123,n) + 3840*binomial(n+122,n) + 1320*binomial(n+121,n) - 9600*binomial(n+120,n) + 6720*binomial(n+119,n) - 200*binomial(n+118,n) - 5760*binomial(n+117,n) - 2880*binomial(n+116,n) + 16000*binomial(n+115,n) - 8640*binomial(n+114,n) - 4800*binomial(n+113,n) + 4400*binomial(n+112,n) + 11520*binomial(n+111,n) - 24640*binomial(n+110,n) + 12000*binomial(n+109,n) + 9440*binomial(n+108,n) - 14160*binomial(n+107,n) - 21760*binomial(n+106,n) + 31200*binomial(n+105,n) - 7560*binomial(n+104,n) - 19600*binomial(n+103,n) + 4160*binomial(n+102,n) + 60080*binomial(n+101,n) - 59520*binomial(n+100,n) + 5120*binomial(n+99,n) + 52160*binomial(n+98,n) + 3240*binomial(n+97,n) - 95680*binomial(n+96,n) + 86240*binomial(n+95,n) + 38576*binomial(n+94,n) - 85440*binomial(n+93,n) - 60800*binomial(n+92,n) + 160520*binomial(n+91,n) - 59450*binomial(n+90,n) - 152736*binomial(n+89,n) + 76480*binomial(n+88,n) + 193280*binomial(n+87,n) - 212640*binomial(n+86,n) - 76960*binomial(n+85,n) + 207520*binomial(n+84,n) + 95520*binomial(n+83,n) - 257600*binomial(n+82,n) - 7300*binomial(n+81,n) + 266560*binomial(n+80,n) - 127680*binomial(n+79,n) - 165200*binomial(n+78,n) + 167520*binomial(n+77,n) + 179680*binomial(n+76,n) - 189920*binomial(n+75,n) - 230016*binomial(n+74,n) + 119640*binomial(n+73,n) + 286320*binomial(n+72,n) - 114400*binomial(n+71,n) - 516320*binomial(n+70,n) + 370248*binomial(n+69,n) + 507040*binomial(n+68,n) - 192160*binomial(n+67,n) - 805440*